# Files that live in the repository but must not be served from smoald.com.
#
# The deploy command is `wrangler pages deploy .` — the whole repository root
# ships as-is, because the site is static and there is nothing to build. That
# is convenient, but it means every working file was being published too:
# docs/tpa-outreach-email.md was serving a third party's email address at a
# public URL, findable by any address harvester.
#
# Anything listed here stays in the repository and stays out of the deploy.
# Syntax is the same as .gitignore.

# Internal notes: profiles, outreach, buyer process. Not site content.
docs

# Build and maintenance scripts — image generators, the prompt eval runner.
scripts

# The deploy workflow itself, which names the Cloudflare account id.
.github

# Development journal.
JOURNAL.md

# Repository housekeeping, meaningless to a visitor.
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.wrangler
